PASS Privacy switch sends authenticated API mutation
PASS Premium does not fabricate a subscription
PASS Unmatched Say hello opens editable draft without writes; explicit Send request is textless
PASS Existing match opens real Thread with unsent suggestion; only Send writes the message
PASS Restricted unmatched draft cannot send
PASS Unmatched Send failure remains an error with no sent confirmation
PASS Incoming invitation accepts only on explicit confirmation and never auto-sends opener
PASS Spark advances without moving next portrait; return from Say hello restores portrait
PASS Password reveal, recovery and visible Google OAuth buttons exist in BOTH auth modes
PASS Google click invokes real OAuth authorize URL (redirect intercepted; not provider acceptance)
PASS Native Settings destination graph has no legacy internal links, dead routes or public chrome
PASS Consent withdrawal requires confirmation and reports queued cleanup honestly
PASS New account, support, blocked-member and full photo-editor surfaces load
PASS Discover actions sit inside the portrait card border
PASS New member profile has supplied details, no legacy fallback and no main tabs
PASS Profile report stays in the new sheet and sends authenticated reason
PASS Profile block requires native confirmation and authenticated API
PASS Discovery filters open matching controls and save real fields
PASS Account email and password forms use existing authenticated contract
PASS Failed account update does not become a success
PASS New support form posts a real message contract
PASS Editor confirms save then returns to the previous member screen
PASS Editor failed save keeps data and expanded native choices
PASS Discovery profile photos enlarge in a new viewer with next/back and focus return
PASS Chat identity opens member profile and offers unmatch in native safety menu
PASS Notification categories, unread toggle and deep link stay in native UI
PASS Notification failure preserves feed and never claims clear succeeded
PASS Verification retains the service flow in matching modal chrome
PASS Account deletion needs typed confirmation and preserves pending cleanup status
PASS Filter uses reference single-track age, ordered sections and docked Save
PASS Editor has accessible fields, section jumps and visible Save dock
PASS Auth keeps the exact reference flame instead of the redesigned mark
PASS Editor persistence failure stays an error, never Profile saved
PASS HTTP failure is displayed, not reported as a save
